as p\'E9rdidas t\'E9rmicas por distribuci\'F3n, acumulaci\'F3n y recirculaci\'F3n. Esta contribuci\'F3n m\'EDnima podr\'E1 reducirse al 60% cuando la demanda de ACS sea inferior a 5000 l/d.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb33\f13\fs18\b0\i1\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li2126\ri1412\qj\sl276\slmult1\f13\fs18\b0\i1\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100\cf9 Se\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 considerar\'E1\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 \'FAnicamente\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 la\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 aportaci\'F3n\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 renovable\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 de\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 la\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 energ\'EDa con\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 origen\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 in\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 situ\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 o\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 en\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 las\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 proximidades\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 del\i1  edificio, o procedente de biomasa s\'F3lida.\'94\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb60\f13\fs18\b0\i1\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li1560\ri1413\qj\sl276\slmult1\f12\fs20\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100\cf9 Como\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \expnd0\expndtw0 vemos\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \expnd0\expndtw0 en\expnd-2\expndtw-12  \expnd0\expndtw0 el\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \expnd0\expndtw0 texto\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \expnd0\expndtw0 normativo\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \expnd0\expndtw0 citado\expnd-2\expndtw-12  \expnd0\expndtw0 en\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \expnd0\expndtw0 el\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \expnd0\expndtw0 p\'E1rrafo\expnd-3\expndtw-14  \expnd0\expndtw0 anterior,\expnd-2\expndtw-12  \expnd0\expndtw0 la\expnd-2\expndtw-12  \expnd0\expndtw0 valoraci\'F3n\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \expnd0\expndtw0 de\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \expnd0\expndtw0 la\expnd-2\expndtw-12  \expnd0\expndtw0 demanda\expnd-2\expndtw-12  \expnd0\expndtw0 ha\expnd-2\expndtw-9  \expnd0\expndtw0 de\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \expnd0\expndtw0 incluir la energ\'EDa que se pierde en la conducci\'F3n del agua hasta los puntos de consumo, la que se pierde en la recirculaci\'F3n\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 si existe,\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 as\'ED como\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 la que se disipa al\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 ambiente\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 a trav\'E9s de\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 las paredes\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 del\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 acumulador previsto. Las primeras, distribuci\'F3n y recirculaci\'F3n las estimaremos en un porcentaje, que, en nuestro caso, creemos se aproximar\'E1 a un 5% debemos considerar que por el tama\'F1o de la vivienda no es previsible que exista recirculaci\'F3n ni grandes recorridos de distribuci\'F3n hasta los puntos de consumo.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb36\f12\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li1560\ri1414\qj\sl276\slmult1\f12\fs20\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100\cf9 Respecto a las perdidas producidas en el dep\'F3sito de acumulaci\'F3n realizaremos en el cap\'EDtulo correspondiente un c\'E1lculo aproximado. Su valor depender\'E1 del tama\'F1o del acumulador, de su grado de aislamiento y del salto t\'E9rmico entre la temperatura en su interior y la del ambiente en el que se encuentre situado.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb35\f12\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li1560\ri1412\qj\sl276\slmult1\sb1\f12\fs20\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100\cf9 En\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 el apartado\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 correspondiente\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 veremos cu\'E1l\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 es la aportaci\'F3n\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 renovable del sistema y si se cumplen o no los valores de contri