0 casos\expnd-2\expndtw-12  \expnd0\expndtw0 y\expnd-2\expndtw-12  \expnd0\expndtw0 su\expnd-2\expndtw-12  \expnd0\expndtw0 valor\expnd-2\expndtw-12  \expnd0\expndtw0 es\expnd-2\expndtw-12  \expnd0\expndtw0 1,73.\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \expnd0\expndtw0 Por\expnd-2\expndtw-12  \expnd0\expndtw0 tanto el\expnd-3\expndtw-13  \expnd0\expndtw0 valor\expnd-2\expndtw-12  \expnd0\expndtw0 l\'EDmite\expnd-2\expndtw-12  \expnd0\expndtw0 de\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \expnd0\expndtw0 referencia\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \expnd0\expndtw0 obtenido\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \expnd0\expndtw0 de\expnd-3\expndtw-13  \expnd0\expndtw0 la\expnd-2\expndtw-12  \expnd0\expndtw0 tabla\expnd-2\expndtw-8  \expnd0\expndtw0 3.1.1.b-HE1\expnd-3\expndtw-13  \expnd0\expndtw0 es\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \expnd0\expndtw0 el\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \expnd0\expndtw0 mismo\expnd-3\expndtw-13  \expnd0\expndtw0 en\expnd-2\expndtw-9  \expnd0\expndtw0 ambos\expnd-2\expndtw-12  \expnd0\expndtw0 casos:\expnd-2\expndtw-12  \expnd0\expndtw0 0,48 \expnd0\expndtw-2 W/m\fs12\up7 2\fs20\up0 K.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb35\f12\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s5\ls12\ilvl0\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li2412\fi-286\ri1409\qj\sl276\slmult1\tx2412\f12\fs20\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100\cf9 La principal diferencia en esta opci\'F3n es que la proporci\'F3n de huecos que se introduce en el bajocubierta es superior a la de\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 la opci\'F3n anteriormente\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 estudiada.\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 El programa funcional del bajocubierta en esta configuraci\'F3n es m\'E1s amplio e incluye dos dormitorios con sus aseos y zonas comunes y de circulaci\'F3n. Este caso la superficie de huecos que se incorporan en el bajocubierta es de 10 m\fs12\up7 2\fs20\up0 . Los lucernarios son del tipo \'93balconero\'94, con una parte que se inserta en el fald\'F3n inclinado de cubierta y un m\'F3dulo vertical en el cerramiento de fachada, que en este caso tiene una altura de 1,5 metros en el per\'EDmetro.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb37\f12\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s5\ls12\ilvl0\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li2412\fi-286\ri1410\qj\sl276\slmult1\tx2412\f12\fs20\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100\cf9 Esta\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \expnd0\expndtw0 mayor\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \expnd0\expndtw0 superficie\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \expnd0\expndtw0 de\expnd-2\expndtw-12  \expnd0\expndtw0 huecos\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \expnd0\expndtw0 con\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \expnd0\expndtw0 una\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \expnd0\expndtw0 transmitancia\expnd-2\expndtw-12  \expnd0\expndtw0 superior\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \expnd0\expndtw0 al\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \expnd0\expndtw0 valor\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \expnd0\expndtw0 l\'EDmite\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 de\expnd-2\expndtw-12  \expnd0\expndtw0 [K],\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \expnd0\expndtw0 empeora ligeramente esa \'93media\'94 [K= 0,46 W/m\fs12\up7 2\fs20\up0 K] y se produce un cumplimiento m\'E1s ajustado que en las opciones similares anteriormente estudiadas.\par\sect\sectd\sbkpage\headery0\footery968
