e de los huecos de planta baja.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb39\f12\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s5\ls23\ilvl1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li2386\fi-360\ri1410\qj\sl276\slmult1\tx2386\f12\fs20\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100\cf9 Algo\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 parecido\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 ocurre\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 en la opci\'F3n 2\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 respecto\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 al\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 control de\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 la demanda. No\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 se\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 cumple\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 el\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 valor l\'EDmite de K en la primera configuraci\'F3n debido a una peor relaci\'F3n huecos-opacos de le E.T. computable. En la segunda configuraci\'F3n en cambio, la continuidad por el exterior de la envolvente t\'E9rmica compensa la transmitancia m\'E1s desfavorable de los huecos.\f12\fs20\b0\i0\up0\cf9\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb35\f12\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s5\ls23\ilvl1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li2386\fi-360\ri1412\qj\sl276\slmult1\tx2386\f12\fs20\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100\cf9 La mayor carga de calefacci\'F3n y refrigeraci\'F3n se producen tambi\'E9n en la planta baja, por ser donde se disponen el mayor n\'FAmero de huecos y de mayor superficie. En consecuencia, cuando consideramos como \'FAnico espacio acondicionado el de la planta baja, el reparto de demanda y consumos asociados por unidad de superficie resulta m\'E1s desfavorable. En las opciones\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \expnd0\expndtw0 2\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 y\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \expnd0\expndtw0 3\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 en\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \expnd0\expndtw0 las\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \expnd0\expndtw0 que\expnd-2\expndtw-8  \expnd0\expndtw0 tenemos\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 m\'E1s\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \expnd0\ex