erflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li1560\sl240\slmult1\f12\fs20\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 Debemos\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 por\expnd-2\expndtw-8  \expnd0\expndtw0 tanto\expnd-2\expndtw-9  \expnd0\expndtw0 calcular\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \expnd0\expndtw0 la\expnd-2\expndtw-8  \expnd0\expndtw0 transmitancia\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \expnd0\expndtw0 [U]\expnd-2\expndtw-9  \expnd0\expndtw0 del\expnd-2\expndtw-9  \expnd0\expndtw0 forjado\expnd-2\expndtw-9  \expnd0\expndtw0 en\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 dos\expnd-2\expndtw-8  \expnd0\expndtw0 situaciones\expnd-2\expndtw-8  \expnd0\expndtw-2 diferentes:\par\pard\plain\s5\ls30\ilvl0\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li2280\fi-360\ri1421\qj\sl276\slmult1\sb36\tx2280\f12\fs20\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 FORJADO COMPLETO. En la opci\'F3n 1 la separaci\'F3n entre acondicionado y no habitable se producen toda la superficie del forjado.\f12\fs20\b0\i0\up0\cf1\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb35\f12\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s5\ls30\ilvl0\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li2280\fi-360\ri1418\qj\sl276\slmult1\tx2280\f12\fs20\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 FORJADO PERIMETRO. En la opci\'F3n 2 la separaci\'F3n entre acondicionado de planta baja y no habitable del bajocubierta afecta exclusivamente a la franja perimetral de los espacios no habitables del bajocubierta.\f12\fs20\b0\i0\up0\cf1\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb37\f12\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li1560\sl240\slmult1\sb1\f12\fs20\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 La\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 composici\'F3n\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 del\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 forjado\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 que\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 se\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 utiliza\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 en\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 ambos\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 casos\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 es\exp